<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Festive/ Horror</p>
<p>Page Layout (Optional):</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: The Gnome Tree Is a Classic Christmas tree, but with a twist, Sometimes, there are Animate Small, limbless Scandinavian Christmas Gnomes, such as dolls and ornaments, while outside of the tree, these gnomes are quite mischievous, sometimes when the tree ejects non anomalous Christmas Decorations, and these gnomes will attempt to ‘Decorate’ the containment cell, along with covering up CCTV footage</p>
<p>Central Narrative: These Gnomes Have a Rigid Hierarchy, where each different Gnome does it’s designed task, The Lowest in the hierarchy, The Gnome Guards, can do very simple tasks, as long as there is a group of three or more or them, these Guards are so Basic, that they have been known to accept orders from almost any life form, including humans, making it possible for testing with the object</p>
